# Backend API base URL — injected at BUILD TIME by CRA.
#
# Local development  → set in .env.local (already gitignored)
#   REACT_APP_API_BASE_URL=https://localhost:8443
#
# Railway production → set REACT_APP_API_BASE_URL in the Railway
#   frontend service's "Variables" tab BEFORE the first deploy build.
#   Example: https://connectin-backend.up.railway.app
